# Google OAuth credentials for G-Sync
# See README.md for Google Cloud Console setup instructions.
#
# 1. Create a Google Cloud project at https://console.cloud.google.com
# 2. Enable the Google Drive API
# 3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Desktop application type)
# 4. Copy the client ID below

GSYNC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Client secret (optional for Desktop OAuth clients).
# PKCE is used for code exchange, so a client secret is not strictly required.
# If your OAuth client was created as a "Web application" type, include the secret.
# GSYNC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
